  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "Timing restriction for Other Causes of Action lawsuit",
    "text": "Any separate lawsuit involving Other Causes 6f A6tion, howe.vet, may n.pt be. filed by Lincoln General during the pendency of the Lawsuit"
