    "id": "c006",
    "name": "U.S. Auto limitation of lawsuit claims",
    "text": "Lincoln General further agre~ to enable Defendarti U.S. Auto :lnsuranc~ Services, Inc, (\"U,S. Auto\") to limit the claims it might otherwise seek in the Lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "Right to assert Excess Funds Claims separately",
    "text": "In particular, Lincoln General agrees that U.So Auto may, in a separate lawsuit, assert claims (including, but not limited to a breach of contract claim), based on an allegation that Lincoln General has withheld or retained monies that exceed the maximum profit margin to which U.S. Auto contends Lincoln General is entitled under the 2002 and/or 2003 Quota Share Reinsurance Agreements (\"the E.xcess Funds Claim(s).\""
