    "id": "c008",
    "name": "Separate nucleus for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Lincoln General agrees that the Excess Funds Claim(s) do not adse out of the same nucleus of operative facts as any claims or counterclaims asserted in the Lawsuit, and thus may appropriately be brought in a separate lawsuit."
  },
  {
