    "name": "Tolling for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Lincoln General also agrees to toll the running of the statute of limitations for the the Excess Funds Claim(s) until the Lawsuit has been settled or otherwise finally resolved, including the completion of any appeals."
  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "Preservation of Lincoln General’s limitations defenses",
    "text": "By agreeing to toll the running of the statute of limitations in this fashion, Lincoln General is not waiving its right or ability to assert any limitations defenses which may exist immediately before this agreement is executed."
  },
  {
    "id": "c012",
    "name": "Timing restriction for Excess Funds Claims lawsuit",
    "text": "Finally, any separate lawsuit involving the Excess Funds Claim(s) may not be filed by U.S. Auto dudng the penden.cy of the Lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c013",
    "name": "Separate nucleus for Other Causes of Action",
    "text": "In excl~ange, Defendants agree that the Other Causes of Action do not arise out of the same nucleus of operative facts as any claims or c~untercla!ms asserted in the Lawsuit and thus may appropriately be brought in a separate lawsuit."
  },
  {
