    "name": "Waiver of preclusion defenses for Other Causes of Action",
    "text": "Further, Defendants expressly relinquish and waive their right to assert that the Other Causes of Action are barred by the doctrines of ms judicata or collateral esloppel as a result of any fir~dings of fact, conclusions of la..w, judgments, verdicts, arbitration decisions, or other determinations made as part of the Lawsuit,"
